// A battle opens: a rising broken chord under a fading crash.
sfx
volume max
automation 8ms
instrument call { wave pulse duty 25% volume 11 }
instrument crash { wave noise volume 8 volume_slide { to 0 over 280ms } }
channel 1 call octave 4 {
    a:44ms c':44ms e':44ms a':44ms c'':44ms
    volume_slide { to 0 over 200ms }
    e'':200ms
}
channel 3 crash octave 4 { c:280ms r:140ms }
